        "MAPT"
      ],
      "interpretation": "PC1 contrasts a cell-cycle/proliferation-associated expression pattern with a luminal/ER-associated pattern. PCA sign and loading structure are statistical descriptions, not causal biological mechanisms."
    },
    "limitations": [
      "Cohort-wise rank normalisation uses the full unlabeled expression distribution of each cohort.",
      "The TCGA and METABRIC assays differ: batch-normalised RSEM RNA-seq versus Illumina HT-12 v3 log2 intensities.",
      "Gene-level cBioPortal matrices were used; METABRIC raw probe annotation and duplicate-probe resolution were not independently rederived.",
      "Sample-type metadata were unavailable in the sample projection; primary-tumour-only filtering was not verified.",
      "Rank normalisation cannot guarantee removal of platform, batch, probe or sample-composition effects."
    ]
